<h2>Your shipment is on the way!</h2>
<p>Hello,</p>
<p>Great news! Items from your order <strong>#<%= @order.number %></strong> have been shipped.</p>
<p>Shipment Details:</p>
<ul>
  <% @order.line_items.each do |item| %>
    <li><%= item.product.name %> x <%= item.quantity %></li>
  <% end %>
</ul>
<p>You can track your order status here: <a href="http://localhost:3000/orders/<%= @order.number %>">Order Details</a></p>
<p>Thank you for your business!</p>
